          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सम्भवः — sambhavaḥ — \"a possibility\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यदि धनम् अस्ति, तर्हि यात्रायाः सम्भवः अस्ति। yadi dhanam asti, tarhi yātrāyāḥ sambhavaḥ asti. If there is money, a journey is possible."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सम्भवः (sambhavaḥ) is built on sam, \"together\", and the root √bhū, \"to be\"; MW gives sam-bhava \"capacity, ability, possibility\" (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
